{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1762834,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"light-blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Shri Ram Mathematics Olympiad (SRMO) - 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":1184,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-03T18:30:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-14T21:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"quizzes","public_url":"quiz\/shri-ram-mathematics-olympiad-srmo-2026-srcc-du-1762834","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>The Computers &amp; Mathematics Society (CMS)<\/strong> of <strong>Shri Ram College of Commerce (Asia's top commerce college),<\/strong> established in the 1960s is a student-led society dedicated to exploring<strong> <\/strong>technology, mathematics, and their intersection with various disciplines.<\/p>\n<p>We are thrilled to announce the <strong>Shri Ram Mathematics Olympiad (SRMO) 2026<\/strong>&nbsp;- a <strong>national-level competition<\/strong> that aims to identify, challenge, and celebrate exceptional mathematical talent among school students across India.<br \/>This Olympiad offers a golden opportunity for young minds to test their skills, challenge their intellect, and compete on a prestigious academic platform.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Students from <strong>Classes IX, X, XI, and XII<\/strong> are eligible to participate.<\/li>\n<li>Each grade will have a <strong>distinct syllabus and a separate test<\/strong>, ensuring fair evaluation suited to the participant&rsquo;s academic level.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Exam Structure:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The Olympiad will comprise <strong>one section<\/strong>&nbsp;designed to assess analytical and mathematical aptitude. While the question format may vary slightly, the structure will broadly include:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Main Round <\/strong>&ndash; 50 questions; 60 minutes<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Dates:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Main Round:<\/strong> Saturday, 14th November 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Registration Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fee:<\/strong> \u20b9149 per participant&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rewards and Recognition<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Top 3 students from each grade (IX, X, XI, and XII) will be recognized as winners.<\/li>\n<li>All participants will receive <strong>certificates of participation<\/strong> in recognition of their enthusiasm and commitment to learning.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Why Participate?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strengthen your<strong> <\/strong>logical reasoning and mathematical problem-solving abilities.<\/li>\n<li>Compete with some of the brightest students from across the nation.<\/li>\n<li>Gain <strong>national-level recognition<\/strong> <strong>from SRCC<\/strong> that enhances your academic profile.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>How to Prepare?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Revise your <strong>NCERT Mathematics syllabus<\/strong> thoroughly.<\/li>\n<li>Practice <strong>logical reasoning<\/strong> and <strong>quantitative aptitude<\/strong> questions regularly.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Platform:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Olympiad will be conducted online via Unstop, ensuring a smooth, secure, and convenient experience for all participants.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Registration Now Open!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Don&rsquo;t miss the chance to demonstrate your mathematical excellence and shine as one of the brightest young minds in India.<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Prize Pool worth \u20b950,000","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":507679,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-09-28T22:31:08+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T22:06:18+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"yWFqjiv","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"win